### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Register user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get user info (requires auth)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Create repository (requires auth)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/repos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "my-repo",
  "description": "Test repository",
  "is_private": false
}

### List user repositories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/repos
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get specific repository
GET http://localhost:8080/api/repos/testuser/my-repo
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Delete repository
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/repos/testuser/my-repo
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Git clone (info/refs)
GET http://localhost:8080/git/testuser/my-repo/info/refs?service=git-upload-pack
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get archive
GET http://localhost:8080/git/testuser/my-repo/archive
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
